*.duckdb.wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.parquet

# Phase 6B artifacts. The panel is 13 MB of regenerable intermediate — a
# walk-forward pass over the frozen prediction foundation, rebuilt in ~65s by
# `python scripts/phase6b_backtest.py --rebuild-panel`. The fitted model and the
# report are small, are the evidence behind docs/simulation-readiness.md, and
# are tracked.
artifacts/panel_*.jsonl

